h","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commits/4c5d2cdcc66e16ed214f05734835dd9328ed6bb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:26:49Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:26:49Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-126): performance budget operations — Lighthouse CI, RUM, INP\n\nCovers the three measurement layers (build-time deterministic budgets\nin angular.json, synthetic Lighthouse CI via @lhci/cli@0.14 in PRs,\nRUM via web-vitals@4 in production), the Core Web Vitals targets\n(LCP < 2.5s, INP < 200ms, CLS < 0.1), per-cohort RUM segmentation\n(geo / device / browser / time), the budget-owner pattern for\nsustainable enforcement, the right response to budget breaches\n(investigate, don''t auto-raise), source-map-explorer for diagnosis,\ntypical mobile-vs-desktop perf gaps, and an honest LCP-from-3.2s-to-2.5s\ndiagnostic walkthrough.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17046c6af7f3fcb9b3e961241dcbecf059e5c89f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/17046c6af7f3fcb9b3e961241dcbecf059e5c89f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/4c5d2cdcc66e16ed214f05734835dd9328ed6bb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":