u-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commits/c2703c8535b1952f1a76495eb02837486eefd229/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:54:25Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:54:25Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-125): cross-platform Angular — Capacitor 6, Tauri 2, Electron 33\n\nOpens Track 18 (Frontier Platform & Production). Covers the web-shell\narchitecture (native shell + web view + Angular bundle), @capacitor/core@6\nfor iOS/Android with platform plugins, @tauri-apps/api@2 with Rust-backed\ndesktop + Tauri 2 mobile (5-15 MB bundles vs Electron''s 80-150 MB),\nelectron@33 with mandatory nodeIntegration: false + contextIsolation: true\nsecurity defaults, the platform-detection + native-API-abstraction\nservice pattern that keeps one Angular codebase serving three platforms,\ndistribution channels per platform (App Store, Play Store, signed\ndesktop installers), build-vs-buy decisions for Capacitor plugins, and\nan honest Tauri-vs-Electron decision matrix for 2026.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb0c4d8ca59fd1a6a5a8272c22cf04edb9ace8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/eb0c4d8ca59fd1a6