— Cypress vs Playwright vs Vitest\n\nCovers the test pyramid layer between unit and E2E, the four contenders\n(cypress@13 Component for best DX, @playwright/experimental-ct-angular@1.50\nfor multi-browser + Playwright unification, vitest@2 browser mode +\n@analogjs/vitest-angular@1 for speed, and Karma replacement paths),\nspeed/CI/debugging trade-offs, what fits component tests vs unit tests\n(real-DOM-dependent vs pure logic), mocking patterns with MSW@2 +\nTestBed providers, and an honest decision framework for the\nKarma-deprecated migration that Angular 19+ projects face.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce6348a8dce8facf192257535bdbbf6621857b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/ce6348a8dce8facf192257535bdbbf6621857b92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/f74253a94253c58244a5905e18f43f7e679da63f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commit/f74253a94253c58244a5905e18f43f7e679da63f","node_id":"C_kwDOSPk6PtoAKGY3NDI1M2E5NDI1M2M1ODI0NGE1OTA1ZTE4ZjQzZjdlNjc5ZGE2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commit/53ff03f7832de01c92e0fdebd4ba24d5ab6b38c8","sha":"53ff03f7832de01c92e0fdebd4ba24d5ab6b38c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commits/53ff03f7832de01c92e0fdebd4ba24d5ab6b38c8"}],"sha":"f74253a94253c58244a5905e18f43f7e679da63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commits/f74253a94253c58244a5905e18f43f7e679da63f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commits/53ff03f7832de01c92e0fdebd4ba24d5ab6b38c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:24:28Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:24:28Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-121): multi-brand design systems — tokens, white-label, theme switching\n\nCovers the build-time vs runtime branding decision, the W3C DTCG token\nformat with three-layer architecture (primitives -> semantic ->\ncomponent), style-dictionary@4 build pipeline emitting per-brand CSS\nfiles scoped via [data-brand], runtime brand detection from host /\nJWT / cookie + APP_INITIALIZER setup, brand-specific assets (logos,\nfonts via lazy-load, localized copy), token-driven components that\nnever hardcode colors, dark mode within a brand via combined\n[data-brand][data-theme] selectors, brand governance via zod schemas\n+ WCAG contrast checks in CI, multi-brand visual regression testing,\nand an honest cost/benefit analysis of multi-brand support.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"658df88dd680700beec3ec972d031c549d05a1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/658df88dd680700beec3ec972d031c549d05a1f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/53ff03f7832de01c92e0fdebd4ba24d5ab6b38c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ng