h/angular-kb/commits/4aedec1dd1bf208512c8ec5fa0c9220a216c492f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:58:16Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:58:16Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-120): AI coding assistants for Angular — Cursor, Claude Code, MCP\n\nCovers the 2026 AI assistant landscape (Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot,\nCline, Aider) and the layers of capability (autocomplete -> agent\nmode), the critical project-rules file (CLAUDE.md / .cursorrules /\nAGENTS.md) tying AI output to team conventions and Angular version,\nthe pattern of effective prompting (specific, scoped, with constraints),\nMCP servers (filesystem + git + GitHub as defaults; custom only when\nteam-size justifies maintenance), agent mode boundaries (great for\nmechanical refactors, dangerous for unbounded tasks), the code review\ndiscipline that distinguishes AI-as-accelerator from AI-as-bug-amplifier,\nand Angular-specific failure modes (mixing eras, hallucinated APIs,\nstale version assumptions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b5a13c10d12d62901ac489266dc11ec37fe3df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/7b5a13c10d12d62901ac489266dc11ec37fe3df2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/4aedec1dd1bf208512c8ec5fa0c9220a216c492f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co