s the modern subscription-cleanup answer,\nweb-vitals@4 + Sentry/Datadog RUM for real-user metrics, common Angular\nbottlenecks (inline object inputs, impure pipes, expensive template\nexpressions, CDK virtual scroll, hydration mismatch, bundle bloat),\nand the disciplined reproduce -> categorize -> profile -> fix -> verify\ndiagnostic flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"266fe3a24804c1231078faf2aaff719e392c16a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/266fe3a24804c1231078faf2aaff719e392c16a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/91387f0f2f0e602b0131a9e5a43f4e9afa50b20f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commit/91387f0f2f0e602b0131a9e5a43f4e9afa50b20f","node_id":"C_kwDOSPk6PtoAKDkxMzg3ZjBmMmYwZTYwMmIwMTMxYTllNWE0M2Y0ZTlhZmE1MGIyM