gular/ssr@19+ with AngularAppEngine\nfor Web-standard Request/Response, hono@4 as the universal adapter\nacross Cloudflare/Vercel/Deno/Bun, full wrangler.toml + vercel.json\nsetups, the cold-start math (~5ms vs Lambda''s ~1000ms), bundle-size\ndiscipline, edge-friendly DB drivers (Neon, PlanetScale, D1, Hyperdrive),\nhybrid edge+origin architectures, and an honest decision matrix on\nwhen edge SSR earns its complexity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4f47b0d94d8712539355907740b5581558d8759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/c4f47b0d94d8712539355907740b5581558d8759"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/cdc004613862583c65183d9a90369bd2fe997f42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/commit/cdc004613862583c65183d9a90369bd2fe997f42"