auAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-111): zoneless production migration — removing zone.js end-to-end\n\nCovers what zone.js does (and costs), what provideZonelessChangeDetection()\nreplaces it with (signal-driven CD), the 6-step migration mechanics\n(config flip, OnPush audit, imperative listener conversion, RxJS field\nmutations, third-party library compatibility, testing), debugging\nthe new failure mode (silent staleness instead of errors), the\n\"prepare-without-migrating\" hybrid path for large enterprise apps,\nwhy NgZone still ships as a stub for compat, and a feature-flagged\nphased rollout pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a3e037d04eef7f30312ee836b6ba4f6753eb30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/4a3e037d04eef7f30312ee836b6ba4f6753eb30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/614e6ab54aed7282ebc37136b425081fac3f6c5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"Use