:"2026-05-01T20:23:23Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-110): incremental hydration — @defer + SSR partial hydration\n\nCovers withIncrementalHydration() + withEventReplay() (the silent hero\nthat prevents click loss during hydration), all @defer triggers (idle,\nviewport, hover, interaction, immediate, timer, when), prefetch vs\nhydrate two-phase lifecycle, when NOT to use @defer, debugging via\nNgDevTools'' hydration tab, the typical 60-80% upfront-JS reduction on\ncontent-heavy pages, and a complete production checklist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee4e466690d6984544de6054bb85b8debe3d6df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/ee4e466690d6984544de6054bb85b8debe3d6df0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/267a4a02fa43d4770b5076806744423db59a4e38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use