s.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"feat(topic-109): Signal Forms — v20+ replacement for Reactive Forms\n\nOpens Track 16 (Frontier Angular & Production Operations). Covers the\nnew @angular/forms/signals API: form() + schema() composition, Standard\nSchema integration with zod/valibot/arktype for unified API+form\nvalidation, conditional fields via discriminated unions, async validators\nwith debounce + cancellation, field-level state signals, ControlValueAccessor\nbridging, and a principled migration path that resists big-bang rewrites\nwhile developer preview API churns.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bcd9aa2867c609b1fc8ddb45d2222dee893cd45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/0bcd9aa2867c609b1fc8ddb45d2222dee893cd45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/0469811f82851416b2c65feea9393d04e2a30495","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht