T19:21:01Z","email":"twas.horus@gmail.com","name":"NguyenMauAnh"},"message":"chore(curriculum): expand with Track 16 — Frontier Angular & Production Operations\n\nAdds 8 new advanced topics (109-116) covering frontier Angular APIs and\nproduction-operational concerns: Signal Forms (v20+), Incremental\nHydration with @defer + SSR, Zoneless production migration, Angular\nDevKit custom builders, Edge SSR via Cloudflare Workers/Vercel Edge/Hono,\nAngular profiling deep dive (signal graph, CD profiler), browser storage\n(OPFS, IndexedDB, offline-first sync), and end-to-end type-safe APIs\nwith Hono RPC + ts-rest from Angular consumers.\n\nTotal topics: 109 -> 117.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddbfa6d24106511da1d314e7b5d3b00fd5f0da34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/trees/ddbfa6d24106511da1d314e7b5d3b00fd5f0da34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/angular-kb/git/commits/79601ced3ad8d73f14e5dee41d7cce9606c679f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26936602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nguyen-Mau-Anh","id":26936602,"login":"Nguyen-Mau-Anh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTM2NjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nguyen-Mau-Anh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.