ulhanna/micro-frontend/commits/b79f938238a29be19fabea26ba0b59d078eb1228/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T14:12:10Z","email":"aiwancm@gmail.com","name":"Aiwan01"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T14:12:10Z","email":"aiwancm@gmail.com","name":"Aiwan01"},"message":"feat: add RemoteWatchPlugin for near-instant auto-reload on remote changes\n\nCross-boundary HMR (webpack ↔ Vite) is not natively possible, but this\ngives ~1-2s auto-reload DX: vite build --watch rebuilds the remote, webpack\ndetects remoteEntry.js changed via fileDependencies, writes a new timestamp\nto shell/remote-version.js, HMR fires for products.jsx, localStorage version\ncomparison triggers window.location.reload() so federation fetches fresh bundle.\n\n- shell/next.config.js: RemoteWatchPlugin watches ../remote/dist/remoteEntry.js\n- shell/pages/products.jsx: import remoteVersion, auto-reload via localStorage\n- shell/remote-version.js: generated sentinel file (gitignored, auto-created on start)\n- .gitignore: ignore shell/remote-version.js\n- package.json: add dev:remote:watch script\n- README: document 3-terminal auto-reload workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ce01f2eed7318830c121e5e1eedcc4b99607cd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulhanna/micro-frontend/git/trees/8ce01f2eed7318830c121e5e1eedcc4b99607cd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulhanna/micro-frontend/git/commits/b79f938238a29be19fabea26ba0b59d078eb1228","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178729901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiwan01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiwan01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiwan01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiwan01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h