xJS-based time service with Intl.DateTimeFormat DST support\n  - Service unit tests (4 tests passing)\n- Phase 2 US1: View multiple country times (T014-T040) ✅\n  - WorldClockEntryComponent: Reusable clock display card\n    - Computed formattedTime signal using Intl.DateTimeFormat\n    - Computed ariaLabel for accessibility\n    - Material design with color tokens, responsive typography\n  - WorldClockPageComponent: Main container with state management\n    - Signal-based state: entries, currentFormat, isLoading, error\n    - Effect-based subscription to time service\n    - Responsive grid layout with BreakpointObserver\n    - Material Material components (mat-card, mat-button, mat-spinner)\n  - Route integration: /world-clock route added to app.routes.ts\n  - Menu integration: World Clock item in sidebar-menu.json\n  - E2E tests: Navigation and verification tests\n\nBuild Status: ✅ Production build successful (bundle size warning pre-existing)\nTests: ✅ All 8 component tests passing\nTypeScript: ✅ No compilation errors\n\nNext: Phase 2.5 (US2 - live updates), Phase 3 (US3 - responsive polish), Phase 4 (validation)","tree":{"sha":"9de338d87b36c9437ff129371108b7797b60b471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satake-dev/spec-as-source-angular-demo/git/trees/9de338d87b36c9437ff129371108b7797b60b471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satake-dev/spec-as-source-angular-demo/git/commits/515d825d0440e6219bed46d37d03649f5c3147e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195923255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satake-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satake-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satake-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satake-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satake-dev","id":19592325