af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:57:34Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:57:34Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"message":"fix: OpenAI SDK をやめ fetch で直接 API を叩く\n\nopenai パッケージは api.openai.com など多数のドメインを bundle に\n埋め込み、XRift のセキュリティチェック(no-unauthorized-domain)で\nREJECT されるため、OpenAI 互換の Chat Completions を fetch + SSE で\n直接呼ぶ実装に変更。\n\n- openai 依存を削除\n- streamChat ヘルパーで SSE ストリームをパース\n- xrift.json に allowedDomains: llm.ponkotsu-lab.net を追加\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"294d286889ca3f4c0fa23f8e0fa0135228b07ddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-robot/git/trees/294d286889ca3f4c0fa23f8e0fa0135228b07ddd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-robot/git/commits/e65a23531713d5eab08683f8344b4152e88efcaf","verification":{"payload":"tree 294d286889ca3f4c0fa23f8e0fa0135228b07ddd\nparent 768efd11894535f57b66c1edb231f9d80bd14411\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1783965454 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1783965454 +0900\n\nfix: OpenAI SDK をやめ fetch で直接 API を叩く\n\nopenai パッケージは api.openai.com など多数のドメインを bundle に\n埋め込み、XRift のセキュリティチェック(no-unauthorized-domain)で\nREJECT されるため、OpenAI 互換の Chat Completions を fetch + SSE で\n直接呼ぶ実装に変更。\n\n- openai 依存を削除\n- streamChat ヘルパーで SSE ストリームをパース\n- xrift.json に allowedDomains: llm.ponkotsu-lab.net を追加\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHg1w7A9nGcvs5fTy0nTaiFAW+SVllV29WNAMshrm2kiVDbQv3+SNbYNMwtwRa3y0q\nwFueBUlLFlD8gPEq0GTw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T17:57:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconte