github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/714515e2fed5b81eac76174047080ccc4c644719/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:45:12Z","email":"accdong@gmail.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:45:12Z","email":"accdong@gmail.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"fix(image): cold-start 타임아웃 방지 위해 생성 타임아웃 상향·정렬\n\n정보탐색 이미지 생성이 \"Image generation timed out.\"으로 실패.\n원인: 서버 GEN_TIMEOUT_MS 180s가 첫 요청 cold-start(모델 다운로드+로드)\n를 못 버팀. 클라 폴링 상한 192s도 서버보다 짧아 정렬 안 됨.\n\n- diffusersProvider: 기본 타임아웃 180s→300s\n- imageGen 클라 폴링 160→270회(324s), 서버 타임아웃이 먼저 발생하도록\n  여유 둬 원본 에러 메시지 보존\n- .env.example: 신규 기본값 + IMAGE_WORKER_WARMUP 문서화\n\n근본 해결은 IMAGE_WORKER_WARMUP=1(pre-load), 타임아웃 상향은 안전망.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ea9591cfdc437c43cd5e4b51069743e5580bff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/2ea9591cfdc437c43cd5e4b51069743e5580bff9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/714515e2fed5b81eac76174047080ccc4c644719","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","si