ub.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/8872a76b2bdcc0a37e0f220040ca3e5b192c11e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:22:03Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:22:03Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"이미지 생성 운영·보안·확장 (Phase 5)\n\n- server/imageGeneration/comfyImageProvider.js: ComfyUI provider(인터페이스 완성).\n  핀 고정 workflow JSON에 %PROMPT%/%SEED% 등 토큰 치환, /prompt 큐잉 + /history 폴링.\n  imageProvider PROVIDERS에 등록 → IMAGE_PROVIDER=comfyui 로 교체 가능\n- imageSafety: Node 측 차단어(방어적 심층) — 노출/공문서 위조 의도 거부\n- chat.js: 생성 이미지 카드에 \"AI 생성 · 모델\" 출처 배지\n- adminStats: 관리자 통계 패널에 이미지 워커 상태 카드\n  (provider/워커/티어/모델/디바이스/큐/일일한도, 온라인 표시 dot)\n- .env.example: COMFYUI_URL, COMFYUI_WORKFLOW_TEXT2IMG\n\n기존 운영 항목(retention 잡, 일일 한도, metadata-only 로그, PNG AI-생성 태그,\n/api/admin/image/status, Provider 추상화)은 Phase 1-2에서 이미 반영됨.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6b06eb2e56de349af3e8e9ef4f67e9dcaf7dc06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/f6b06eb2e56de349af3e8e9ef4f67e9dcaf7dc06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/8872a76b2bdcc0a37e0f220040ca3e5b192c11e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/8872a76b2bdcc0a37e0f220040ca3e5b192c11e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSQjaKdoAKDg4NzJhNzZiMmJkY2MwYTM3ZTBmMjIwMDQwY2EzZTViMTkyYzExZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9","sha":"646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9"}],"sha":"8872a76b2bdcc0a37e0f220040ca3e5b192c11e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/8872a76b2bdcc0a37e0f220040ca3e5b192c11e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T09:13:24Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T09:13:24Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"인포그래픽 v2 (Phase 4): SVG 렌더러 전면 재작성 + 생성 이미지 합성\n\n수치/차트/출처는 myAI SVG 렌더러가 직접 렌더링하고, 이미지 모델은\n배경/아이콘만 담당. 빠른 생성(이미지 없음)과 고급 생성(배경/아이콘 포함) 분리.\n\n- server/infographic.js: v2 스키마 — 새 블록 hero/chart_bar/chart_line/flow,\n  visualAssets(generated_background/icon), version \"2.0\"/renderMode \"svg_composite\".\n  기존 5개 블록 타입·정규화·테스트는 그대로 보존(additive)\n- server/infographic/assetPlanner.js: 고급 모드 배경/아이콘 프롬프트 계획 후\n  imageProvider로 생성→saveAsset. 워커 미가용/실패 시 graceful(경고만)\n- /api/studio/infographic: mode \"fast\"|\"advanced\" 추가\n- public/modules/infographicStudio.js: HTML/CSS 렌더러를 SVG 렌더러로 교체.\n  수직 흐름 레이아웃 엔진(CJK 폭 측정·줄바꿈), 블록별 SVG 렌더러, 배경 image 합성,\n  PNG export(SVG 직렬화 + 이미지 data-URI 인라인), buildInfographicSvg 순수 함수 분리\n- 빠른/고급 생성 버튼, SVG 반응형 CSS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba14291383f7e324432ca8cb3836365328866354","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/ba14291383f7e324432ca8cb3836365328866354"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9","node_id":"C_kwDOSQjaKdoAKDY0NmE5Y2YyMjU0YzExNDE2YTU0NmYwODBjZTNmNmM3YzI2ZDk2Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86","sha":"d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86"}],"sha":"646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/646a9cf2254c11416a546f080ce3f6c7c26d96f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T08:38:55Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T08:40:04Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"이미지 생성 기능 도입 (Phase 0-3): 워커 + 게이트웨이 API + 정보탐색 UI\n\nOllama에 종속시키지 않고 별도 이미지 Provider 계층/런타임으로 분리.\n하드웨어 사양에 맞춰 모델을 .env 설정만으로 업/다운그레이드 가능.\n\n- Phase 0: 하드웨어 티어 설계 문서(docs/IMAGE_GENERATION_PLAN.md), .env 이미지 설정\n- Phase 1: Python 이미지 워커(services/image-worker, FastAPI+Diffusers)\n  티어 기반 모델/VRAM auto 감지, OOM 자동 해상도 강등, CPU offload, 스타일 프리셋\n- Phase 2: Node 게이트웨이(server/imageGeneration) — Provider 추상화, imageQueue\n  (텍스트 큐 분리, concurrency 1), /api/image/* job 기반 API, asset store + retention,\n  프롬프트 검증 + 사용자별 일일 한도\n- Phase 3: 정보탐색 명시 토글 이미지 생성 UI, generated_image 메시지 렌더,\n  워커 미가용 시 토글 자동 숨김(graceful degradation)\n\nvLLM 전환은 범위 외. 인포그래픽 v2 SVG(Phase 4) 후속.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b8d5bc0e0284bd7a78eb1bc5333201b72e924b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/5b8d5bc0e0284bd7a78eb1bc5333201b72e924b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86","node_id":"C_kwDOSQjaKdoAKGQxZGZkNjI0OWRiYWU3YmI3NzUyNjZmMjFkOGYxZTJjZTBjYmZjODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216/myAI/commit/2db1e312cb74728e0622c6fff4760b1191de8ade","sha":"2db1e312cb74728e0622c6fff4760b1191de8ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/2db1e312cb74728e0622c6fff4760b1191de8ade"}],"sha":"d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/d1dfd6249dbae7bb775266f21d8f1e2ce0cbfc86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu