sch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/e8c123ed57038d9d829c31dc9544b28aab8f110a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T12:39:49Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T12:39:49Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"인포그래픽 스튜디오 추가: 근거 기반 구조화 JSON 렌더링\n\n첨부문서·지식팩·법령/내부검토 결과를 요약/타임라인/절차/비교 4종\n레이아웃으로 시각화. LLM은 검증 가능한 InfographicSpec JSON만 생성하고\n서버가 정제, 프론트가 SVG/HTML로 렌더링해 내부자료 외부 노출을 차단.\n블록별 출처(citation) 표기, 모델 실패 시 문서 요약 기반 fallback, PNG\n내보내기 지원. 마인드맵 패턴을 본떠 구현.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"300c112bf626d7c23349d7fc521f77861d52fcf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/300c112bf626d7c23349d7fc521f77861d52fcf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/e8c123ed57038d9d829c31dc9544b28aab8f110a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https: