ps://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/89dd7227f52acef60a3bcf1a52d2145193d9f247"}],"sha":"a8acef470c1aadfa2a0b4402f0be8afd368a86df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/a8acef470c1aadfa2a0b4402f0be8afd368a86df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/commits/89dd7227f52acef60a3bcf1a52d2145193d9f247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:06:52Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:06:52Z","email":"156396898+Ubermensch216@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ubermensch216"},"message":"내부검토(GRC) 이력 관리 도입\n\n대화방·법령검토와 동일한 패턴으로 GRC 검토 이력 목록을 사이드바에 추가하고, 좌측 입력 UI(검토기준/검토대상문서)를 중앙 패널 상단으로 이동. 각 검토 항목별로 입력·결과·스튜디오 산출물을 독립 보관.\n\n- state: grcReviews 컬렉션과 헬퍼(ensureGrcReviewsState, getActiveGrcReview, ensureGrcReviewStudio, createGrcReview) 추가\n- persistence: grcReviews를 saveAppState 페이로드와 loadAppState 복원에 포함\n- HTML: data-view-content=\"grc\" 사이드바에 newGrcReviewButton과 grcReviewList 마크업\n- app.js: renderGrcReviews, createNewGrcReview, deleteGrcReview, ensureGrcReview 추가하고 renderAll/applyActiveView에 연결. scheduleSave와 renderGrcReviews를 window에 노출하여 Svelte 측 동기화 지원\n- documentStudio.js: openWithPreparedDraft에 grc 분기 추가 — 활성 GrcReview의 studio에 저장하고 source.grcReviewId/sourceType:\"grc_review\" 부여. 이전에는 grc 뷰에서 활성 대화방을 컨텍스트로 잡거나 silent return하여 \"스튜디오 문서로 내보내기\"가 무반응이었던 버그 해결\n- studio.js: grc 뷰는 정상 컨텍스트를 사용하므로 빈 상태 메시지 분기를 calendar에만 유지\n- documentModel.js: normalizeSource에 lawReviewId/grcReviewId 필드 허용\n- main.ts: GrcSidebar 별도 마운트 제거하고 getActiveGrcReview/persistActiveGrcReview 노출. myai:grcreviewchange 이벤트 수신 시 활성 검토로 store 재동기화\n- grcStore: 활성 GrcReview 양방향 동기화 — syncFromActiveReview로 store 채우기, store 변경을 디바운스 구독해 vanilla state에 patch 적용\n- GrcWorkbench: GrcSidebar 컴포넌트를 워크벤치 상단(.grc-inputs-top)에 인라인 배치하고 입력 폼이 가로로 펼쳐지도록 스타일 보강","tree":{"sha":"9c18b430089abb7b68b294c6dbedb4117509cf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/trees/9c18b430089abb7b68b294c6dbedb4117509cf43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ubermensch216/myAI/git/commits/89dd7227f52acef60a3bcf1a52d2145193d9f247","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156396898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ubermensch216","id":156396898,"login":"Ubermensch216","node_id":"U_kgDOCVJtYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ubermensch216/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u