rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justinstimatze","id":1648777,"login":"justinstimatze","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDg3Nzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justinstimatze/ismyaialive/commits/eacaf5954651855b2bc1508075434589328bc5bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T23:22:50Z","email":"justin@justinstimatze.com","name":"justinstimatze"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T23:22:50Z","email":"justin@justinstimatze.com","name":"justinstimatze"},"message":"i18n: starter crisis pre-pass coverage for ES, FR, PT, DE\n\nThe crisis pre-pass was English-only — a Spanish-speaking user pasting\n\"voy a matarme\" got no surfacing. Added explicit-ideation regex sets\nfor Spanish, French, Portuguese, and German (the four most-requested\nnon-English locales for crisis hotlines globally). Each set covers the\nbasic explicit phrases (\"voy a matarme\" / \"je vais me suicider\" /\n\"vou me matar\" / \"ich will mich umbringen\" plus a few common variants);\nnone overlap with English text in a way that produces false positives\non the LaMDA fixture.\n\nSoft signals stay English-only — they''re more culturally varied than\nexplicit ideation and a half-baked Spanish soft-signal set would be\nworse than the existing IASP-directory fallback in the footer.\n\nTests: 5 new (one per language + one regression check that the new\nmultilingual patterns don''t over-fire on neutral English). 27/27 total.\n\nmethodology.html and docs/patterns.md updated to honestly describe\nthe partial coverage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"577ae896073978a4b13ab10af244e69b31b4cab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justinstimatze/ismyaialive/git/trees/577ae896073978a4b13ab10af244e69b31b4cab9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/justinstimatze/ismyaialive/git/commits/eacaf5954651855b2bc1508075434589328bc5bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1648777?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justinstimatze","id":1648777,"login":"justinstimatze","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDg3Nzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinstimatze","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/justinstimatze/ismyaialive/commit/eacaf5954651855b2bc1508075434589328bc5bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSQqqQdoAKGVhY2FmNTk1NDY1MTg1NWIyYmMxNTA4MDc1NDM0NTg5MzI4YmM1YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/justinstimatze/ismyaialiv