events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/23ccb263be8f3b7221569e2e8dfbba46e1e121c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:14:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:14:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: mark forks and background agents on every branch surface, and fix the DEF-12 badge overflow\n\n- mark each conversation wherever one can be picked: the Manage Sessions\n  popup carries a branch icon on a fork and a bg chip on an agent-held\n  conversation, both right-click submenus append a (bg) suffix and keep\n  their icon column for the submenu''s own intent, so the two adjacent\n  submenus never read as identical lists\n- add an include_bg opt-in to list_branches, served from a poll-refreshed\n  roster snapshot (bg_agents_cached, 35s max age) so a right-click never\n  pays the 0.4s `claude agents --json` spawn on the click path - 400ms\n  down to 2ms, and the fork watcher''s 2s poll stays spawn-free\n- put the branch marker in its own flex cell so it survives the label''s\n  ellipsis on long conversation titles\n- fix DEF-12''s second, independent cause: the branch badge is inline-flex\n  with vertical-align middle inside the name span and its text inherited\n  the row''s 24px line-height, growing the span''s line box to 25.09px in a\n  fixed 24px row; 1px of genuine overflow paints a full arrow-button\n  scrollbar on classic-scrollbar platforms. line-height 1.3 on the badge,\n  the value bgBadge already carried\n- record both in docs/defects.md and the acc-crit doc; gitignore tmp/\n\npytest 136, jest 72, galata 7, lint clean","tree":{"sha":"6d51ae7c6fdb363c915d9a8911ef831560b424b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/6d51ae7c6fdb363c915d9a8911ef831560b424b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/23ccb263be8f3b7221569e2e8dfbba46e1e121c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api