s://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/bf51c44f0338c9f426ce9c9aedf8f20923c3e126/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:10:10Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:10:10Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: catch fire-and-forget promise rejections spilling to the console\n\nDisposing a JupyterLab dialog rejects its launch() promise with\nundefined; the panel launched the spinner and branch-popup dialogs\nfire-and-forget and then disposed them, so every terminal launch and\nbranch action emitted an \"Uncaught (in promise) undefined\" to the\nbrowser console.\n\n- guard both dialog.launch() calls with .catch(() => undefined)\n- stop _switchBranch''s finally fetch from rejecting its void callers\n- route the two commands.execute calls (terminal:create-new,\n  filebrowser:go-to-path) through _showError instead of a bare void","tree":{"sha":"eb7b54e7803dc4f5b24c49ada5f041d984c51327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/eb7b54e7803dc4f5b24c49ada5f041d984c51327"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/bf51c44f0338c9f426ce9c9aedf8f20923c3e126","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gra