.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/eb421d1f9fcec977c984953c1e3bdce5bf7b5d52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:47:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:47:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: align the context-menu divider and add a favourites icon\n\nThe separator under \"Copy Session ID\" rendered as two misaligned segments -\nthe line under the icon column sat at a different height than under the text.\n\n- style/base.css: the Lumino menu is a display:table and JupyterLab draws a\n  separator as a border-top on an ::after inside every cell of the row, so\n  all segments must share one baseline. The extension''s\n  .lm-Menu-itemIcon { vertical-align: middle } (added to centre real icons)\n  also hit the separator''s icon cell, offsetting its segment. Scope the rule\n  with :not([data-type=''separator'']) so the separator cells realign\n- src/widget.ts: give the toggle-favourite command icon: starFilledIcon, the\n  same star used on starred rows, so the item matches the other menu actions","tree":{"sha":"04617926450d787ec9baf4cb5462896d549b9f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/04617926450d787ec9baf4cb5462896d549b9f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/eb421d1f9fcec977c984953c1e3bdce5bf7b5d52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stella