 that maps the design tokens onto JupyterLab --jp-* theme variables\n- list is now a surface card with hairline-separated 30px rows; search gains\n  an accent focus ring; Open is an outlined-accent list button, Copy a\n  wireframe action-icon, times use tabular-nums\n- Delete is an outline in every state (neutral when disabled, error outline\n  when armed, soft tint on hover - never a solid fill)\n- remap --ccs-text-subtle to --jp-ui-font-color2 so times and the \"current\"\n  marker stay legible (font-color3 washes out in dark themes)\n- DOM and behaviour unchanged; all acceptance criteria and jest contracts hold","tree":{"sha":"1d58842ff5669f682649c0a011859d3a1becce1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/1d58842ff5669f682649c0a011859d3a1becce1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/9a08e3bc441f09e8a0a78bee926849beb228290d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commit/9a08e3bc441f09e8a0a78bee926849beb228290d","node_id":"C_kwDOSQth5toAKDlhMDhlM2JjNDQxZjA5ZThhMGE3OGJlZTkyNjg0OWJlYjIyODI5MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commit/a2d99e9bec9759bcd4b4d5e5a4de064aedbba538","sha":"a2d99e9bec9759bcd4b4d5e5a4de064aedbba538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/a2d99e9bec9759bcd4b4d5e5a4de064aedbba538"}],"sha":"9a08e3bc441f09e8a0a78bee926849beb228290d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/9a08e3bc441f09e8a0a78bee926849beb228290d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/a2d99e9bec9759bcd4b4d5e5a4de064aedbba538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:04:01Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:04:01Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: pin a created branch as the row''s current conversation (DEF-6)\n\nA freshly forked branch appeared in the panel after its first turn but the\nrow stayed on the parent it was forked from. Branch creation relied on\nrecency to make the fork current, but the parent is the conversation the\nuser is actively in, so its JSONL keeps being appended and its mtime\novertakes the fork''s - _resolve_latest then re-picks the parent.\n\n- add set_current_pin (sessions.py), symmetric with switch_branch and the\n  inverse of a new session''s clear_current_pin\n- write the .jl-current pin to the fork id at fork launch (routes.py) so\n  _resolve_latest honours the fork over recency once its JSONL lands; the\n  pin is dangling and harmless until then\n- correct the _branchSession docstring (no longer recency-based)\n- pytest 102 (+4), jest 58, lint clean\n- acc-crit \"Becomes current\" reworked, \"Edge: parent stays active after a\n  fork\" added; DEF-6 registered","tree":{"sha":"134864e970ac06c604c738719a2d19ee1842611f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/134864e970ac06c604c738719a2d19ee1842611f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/a2d99e9bec9759bcd4b4d5e5a4de064aedbba538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gr