larshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/ebe7225bc66021bdf2bb78b8dbfda5882a1c96ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:13:14Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:13:14Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: force branch session name via claude -n\n\nBranch sessions reverted to the parent conversation''s name because\nclaude --fork-session copies the parent JSONL (inheriting its\ncustom-title) and re-stamps that title every turn, burying the single\ncustom-title record appended after the fork. The fork now launches with\nclaude -n <name>, so claude owns the display name and re-stamps the\nchosen name itself - it sticks. launch-terminal accepts and validates\nan optional name and appends -n <name> to the argv.","tree":{"sha":"abcc751e64d2d276eb7786d87d94573d3dac11d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/abcc751e64d2d276eb7786d87d94573d3dac11d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/ebe7225bc66021bdf2bb78b8dbfda5882a1c96ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenso