_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/abb114381d3bc44d7500466ada339dbe19a94948/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:21:23Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:21:23Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: honour Claude session name so /rename shows in the panel (v1.1.21)\n\nA session renamed in Claude (e.g. /rename scandi) still displayed the\nfolder basename. The latest-wins picker already resolved the cwd to the\nrenamed record, but since v1.1.8 session_state_by_cwd dropped the name\nfield and list_sessions hard-coded name = basename.\n\n- sessions.py: session_state_by_cwd keeps the latest record''s name;\n  list_sessions uses it (name_source=\"session\"), falling back to the\n  folder basename only when missing or blank\n- src/widget.ts: _displayName honours the session name in folder mode\n- src/types.ts: name_source union is now ''session'' | ''basename''\n- schema/plugin.json: presentationMode description rewritten\n- tests: replaced the two asserting the old \"ignored\" behaviour, added\n  test_latest_pid_name_wins_after_rename (mirrors proposals->scandi) and\n  test_blank_pid_name_falls_back_to_basename\n\nTradeoff: folders where Claude auto-derived a topic now show that topic\nrather than the bare folder name - the field carries both with no flag.\n\npytest 35/35, jest 6/6, build:lib + lint:check clean.","tree":{"sha":"c6fa5ce38b151477eff4e0e30eaf07d291da2b50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/trees/c6fa5ce38b151477eff4e0e30eaf07d291da2b50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/git/commits/abb114381d3bc44d7500466ada339dbe19a94948","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commit/abb114381d3bc44d7500466ada339dbe19a94948","node_id":"C_kwDOSQth5toAKGFiYjExNDM4MWQzYmM0NGQ3NTAwNDY2YWRhMzM5ZGJlMTlhOTQ5NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commit/5cd7e3817cdc9ec7f51db2b6a4b7eb34099532ea","sha":"5cd7e3817cdc9ec7f51db2b6a4b7eb34099532ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_claude_code_extension/commits/5cd7e3817cdc9ec7f51db2b6a4b7eb34099532ea"}],"sh