jQ3NzkyNjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiruiCao","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LiruiCao/banking-portal/commits/ad88850df0a08f31ff98837637071dc253203aef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:35:48Z","email":"47792631+LiruiCao@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LiruiCao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:35:48Z","email":"47792631+LiruiCao@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LiruiCao"},"message":"test: switch test runner to Jest and add unit tests across payments\n\nMigrate from Karma + Jasmine to Jest (jest-preset-angular):\n- add jest.config.js, setup-jest.ts (setupZoneTestEnv), root tsconfig.spec.json\n- point npm test at jest; remove karma/jasmine deps and angular.json test targets\n- per-project tsconfig.spec.json use jest + node types\n\nAdd specs for all logic units (88 tests, 16 suites):\n- state: e-transfer + transactions reducers, selectors, effects\n  (limits, auto-deposit skip rule, cross-feature history bridge)\n- components: amount, recipient, review, success, flow-shell,\n  security, payments-home\n\nBoy Scout fixes to go green under Jest:\n- transactions-list spec: jasmine spyOn -> jest.spyOn\n- shell app.component spec: replace stale scaffold test with real\n  brand/nav/router-outlet assertions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e30588f1a615ee541fdee375028f7e692a8bd06a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LiruiCao/banking-portal/git/trees/e30588f1a615ee541fdee375028f7e692a8bd06a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LiruiCao/banking-portal/g