i.github.com/users/rleusmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/commits/f88cb6fa47e784270be1f8fabf1674ab7d5ea812/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T08:02:15Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T08:02:15Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"message":"docs: Architekturdokumentation vollständig aktualisiert\n\nNeue Abschnitte:\n- Dynamische Integration: metadata.ts, APP_INITIALIZER, mfe-manifest.json\n- Framework-Unabhängigkeit: React, Vue, Svelte als Remotes möglich\n- Geteiltes Design System: Web Components via Module Federation teilen\n- Deeplinks: Erklärung und Workarounds\n- Zone.js: Router-Wiederverwendung als dritter Fallstrick dokumentiert\n\nAktualisiert:\n- Systemarchitektur-Diagramm (DynamicMfeWrapper statt spezifische Wrapper)\n- Projektstruktur (metadata.ts, mfe-registry.service.ts, mfe-manifest.json)\n- Neues MFE hinzufügen: nur noch manifest.json eintragen\n- CLAUDE.md: Framework-Unabhängigkeit und Design-System-Sharing ergänzt\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c4a47bba401d6afcf062fc975e006f1043d8a9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/trees/5c4a47bba401d6afcf062fc975e006f1043d8a9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/commits/f88cb6fa47e784270be1f8fabf1674ab7d5ea812","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49947587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.