3NTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/commits/e5f236829b92a9c66c21e7b4a6ed46a4c5803e06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T15:10:35Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T15:10:35Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"message":"fix: Navigation zwischen MFEs ohne Seiten-Reload\n\nAngular wiederverwendet DynamicMfeWrapperComponent bei Parameterwechsel –\nngOnInit wurde nicht erneut aufgerufen, das alte Custom Element blieb.\n\n- route.paramMap als Observable abonniert (statt snapshot)\n- reset() entfernt das vorherige Custom Element und seinen Event-Listener\n- loadToken verhindert Race Conditions bei schneller Navigation\n- load() ist idempotent: bereits geladene Remotes werden direkt gemountet\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"811a2fc9d38f6848e38e8c22004499f2af55c238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/trees/811a2fc9d38f6848e38e8c22004499f2af55c238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/commits/e5f236829b92a9c66c21e7b4a6ed46a4c5803e06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49947587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":