ers/rleusmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/commits/ef1dd742c95f1a8ce71ca505efda5fdadb0e52ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T11:32:35Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T11:32:35Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"message":"feat: zweite Remote-App (orders) mit Navigation in der Shell integriert\n\n- Neue Angular-App `orders` (Port 4202) mit Angular Elements (mfe-orders)\n  - OrdersComponent mit OrderListComponent und OrderCardComponent\n  - ORDER_CANCELLED-Event über mfeAction-Output an Shell weitergeleitet\n  - Webpack Module Federation mit zone.js-Sharing, exposes ./register\n  - CORS-Header für dynamischen ES-Modul-Import konfiguriert\n- Shell erweitert um OrdersWrapperComponent (gleicher Bridge-Pattern wie RemoteWrapper)\n- Navigation im Header mit zwei Links (Produkte / Bestellungen)\n- Routing: /products → RemoteWrapper, /orders → OrdersWrapper\n- EventBusService um ORDER_CANCELLED-Typ erweitert\n- .gitignore um orders/node_modules/ und orders/dist/ ergänzt\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc84a9cff354880fa3645e5f97a388916ebe2bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/trees/fc84a9cff354880fa3645e5f97a388916ebe2bf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/commits/ef1dd742c95f1a8ce71ca505efda5fdadb0e52ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer