ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/commits/f76bae385856780fce74539e678c4538d11168ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T11:12:29Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T11:12:29Z","email":"49947587+rleusmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rleusmann"},"message":"fix: outDir aus Root-tsconfig entfernt, behebt TS6059-Fehler in VS Code\n\noutDir im Root-tsconfig.json ist überflüssig, da tsconfig.app.json und\ntsconfig.spec.json jeweils ihren eigenen outDir setzen. Ohne outDir\nbraucht TypeScript kein rootDir und zeigt keinen Fehler mehr.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46ff5b90062d9356f547944188e66ddbcb38fc6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/trees/46ff5b90062d9356f547944188e66ddbcb38fc6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rleusmann/poc-angular-microfrontend/git/commits/f76bae385856780fce74539e678c4538d11168ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49947587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rleusmann","id":49947587,"login":"rleusmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTQ3NTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rleusmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.