eyword spotting system\n\nDistributed automated information processing system based on ESP32-S3\nmicrocontrollers running local TFLite Micro inference for keyword spotting\nand exchanging short decision-level messages over an ESP-NOW link.\n\nContents:\n- firmware/        ESP32-S3 firmware with TFLite Micro and esp-nn kernels\n- training/        Cloud notebooks for teacher/student training, KD, INT8 PTQ\n- analysis/        Hash-ensemble experiments (homogeneous and heterogeneous)\n- dashboard/       FastAPI master dashboard with temporal voting window\n- scripts/         Serial bridge, cluster simulator, distributed demo launcher\n- run_dashboard.py Project root launcher for the dashboard server","tree":{"sha":"313b66c5ccd9c5463ee1dccf1a7490e7cb2cebdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanilPeg/esp32_distributed_kws/git/trees/313b66c5ccd9c5463ee1dccf1a7490e7cb2cebdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanilPeg/esp32_distributed_kws/git/commits/08e412cf47807701cbe557f2e9883704dd728dbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88672133?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanilPeg","id":88672133,"login":"DanilPeg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NjcyMTMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanilPeg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap