efeb","node_id":"C_kwDOSRBhh9oAKDEzNDNhMDU2ODczNmYwMDIxNTU3YTVhMzI0OGEwYjJmNDlkY2VmZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commit/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273","sha":"0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273"}],"sha":"1343a0568736f0021557a5a3248a0b2f49dcefeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/1343a0568736f0021557a5a3248a0b2f49dcefeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T09:58:28Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T09:58:28Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"fix(examples/customer-dashboard): demo end-to-end funzionante via ESM self-mount\n\nRiscrive il dashboard demo per girare contro v2.0.0 pubblicato (i fix B1/B2\nsono in v2.0.1 patch). Workaround per il GA window:\n\n- host.js: createBroker base + microfrontendModule + governance modules\n  (permissions/compat/isolation/fallbacks). Inspector legge da mfService.list()\n  invece che da getDebugSnapshot.external.mf (incompatibile su Broker base).\n  Lifecycle esplicito load → bootstrap → mount per ogni MF.\n- mf-cart-react.js: lifecycle ctx-aware (resolve target da descriptor.mount.selector)\n  + useGlueZeroPublish con source descriptor esplicito (D-23 conformance).\n- mf-recommendations-wc.js: self-mounting Web Component (bypass webComponentLoader\n  F15 v2.0.0 che non appende al DOM — fixato in v2.0.1).\n- mf-analytics-host.js (NEW): ESM lifecycle che crea+appende iframe + forward\n  broker events via postMessage diretto (bypass iframeLoader F15 v2.0.0 stesso\n  bug DOM-append).\n- index.html: nuovo pannello \"Smoke test\" con bottone Run + 7 assertion\n  end-to-end (3 MF mount, click → event, WC subscribe, iframe receive).\n\nSmoke test: 7/7 ✅ con loader self-mounting.\n\nQuando si rilascia v2.0.1 il demo può tornare a `type: ''web-component''` /\n`type: ''iframe''` con i loader F15 reali (verificato in\nsite/www.gluezero.org/examples/customer-dashboard-f15/, gitignored).","tree":{"sha":"e647a329ecdceb50ce5725b2bce17bd50b3ffdbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/e647a329ecdceb50ce5725b2bce17bd50b3ffdbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commit/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273","node_id":"C_kwDOSRBhh9oAKDAzNjZjMzBjNTdlNzRiMjUxYTFiNDdiZTViNTc4NDRmYzU2MTEyNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commit/3ba48360c786040c6e841d655e8bfe920d4af156","sha":"3ba48360c786040c6e841d655e8bfe920d4af156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/3ba48360c786040c6e841d655e8bfe920d4af156"}],"sha":"0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/0366c30c57e74b251a1b47be5b57844fc5611273"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/3ba48360c786040c6e841d655e8bfe920d4af156/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T09:58:12Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T09:58:12Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"fix(v2.0.1): chiusura 4 BLOCKER scoperti in customer-dashboard E2E verification\n\nB1 — @gluezero/mf-web-component webComponentLoader.mount(ctx) ora appende\nl''element al DOM (resolve da ctx.descriptor.mount.{element,selector}) e\ninietta element.glueZeroBroker per trigger GlueZeroElement.onContextReady().\nNuovo error code MF_WC_MOUNT_TARGET_NOT_FOUND.\n\nB2 — @gluezero/mf-iframe iframeLoader.mount(ctx) ora appende l''iframe al DOM\n(entrambi i path: bridge:true via createIframeLifecycle + bridge:false inline).\nNuovo error code MF_IFRAME_MOUNT_TARGET_NOT_FOUND.\n\nB3 — @gluezero/microfrontends MicroFrontendLoaderDefinitionSchema +\nMicroFrontendMountDefinitionSchema: v.object → v.looseObject. I campi\nloader-specific (elementName, bridge, expectedOrigin, contextMode) non vengono\npiù strippati dalla validation, fixing WC/iframe descriptor usage.\n\nB4 — @gluezero/devtools/mf-inspector JSDoc accurata su compatibilità broker:\ncreateBroker base + service locator (non createDevtoolsBroker che non accetta\nmodules: config).\n\nTests:\n- microfrontends: 372/372 (+4 B3)\n- mf-web-component: 35/35 (+2 B1)\n- mf-iframe: 68/68 (+2 B2)\n- devtools: 332/332 (no regression)\n\nE2E verification (customer-dashboard-f15 con loader F15 REALI): 10/10 ✅","tree":{"sha":"ebe7d99617c288c8605867e4c77bad05b438cd61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/ebe7d99617c288c8605867e4c77bad05b438cd61"},"ur