 primo touchpoint per nuovi adopters arrivati da npm/GitHub non rifletteva la milestone GA appena pubblicata.\n\nAggiornamenti:\n- Banner v2.0.0 GA con highlight 6 punti chiave (microfrontends, governance stack, 4 loaders, React+WC adapters, BC §42 compat, 132 REQ-IDs)\n- Badge Decisions: 170 → 300+ (D-V2-F8-* through F17-20 milestone v2.0)\n- Sezione \"Try it live\" aggiunta 4 v2.0 examples: customer-dashboard (golden showcase) + mf-react-adapter + mf-compat-matrix + 4 carryover MF\n- Sezione \"Try it live\" preserved v1.x runtime + theme examples in blocco separato\n- NEW sezione \"Microfrontend Governance Layer (v2.0, opt-in)\" parallela a \"Theme Layer (v1.1, opt-in)\" — 9 sub-sezioni (Registry+FSM, 4 Loaders, Context+Mapping, Permissions, Compat, Isolation, Fallback, DevTools+Metrics, Framework adapters) + bundle metrics + 3 Quick start adoption levels A/B/C + 2 snippet adapter React/WC\n- Link prominenti: CHANGELOG-v2.md, migration guide A/B/C, GitHub Release v2.0.0, docs/v2/index.md\n\nNO modifica content v1.x esistente — preserved per backward compat documentale.","tree":{"sha":"136e9654ba7ad7522e2247f4f5436a08ff723f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/136e9654ba7ad7522e2247f4f5436a08ff723f73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/4ed8e291ed70f7ebecd94ed1deaf897f79c76103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_ur