04 (no latest resolvable)\n\nFix applicato:\n- Rimosso publishConfig.tag da 13 package.json (compat, context, fallbacks, isolation, mf-{esm,iframe,module-federation,single-spa,web-component}, microfrontends, permissions, react, web-components)\n- npm dist-tag add @gluezero/<pkg>@2.0.0 latest per i 13 (manual fix post-discovery)\n- Smoke test PASS: 16/16 packages installabili via npm install con dist-tag latest=2.0.0\n\nVerifica empirical post-fix:\n$ npm view @gluezero/core dist-tags.latest → 2.0.0 (16/16 confirmed)\n$ npm install @gluezero/core @gluezero/microfrontends @gluezero/react + named exports import → PASS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e47c92938b3cd1a3595b5a0267e05477590596a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/e47c92938b3cd1a3595b5a0267e05477590596a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/e310d9562f3768986d43b3129910868fb4b93105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api