age":"chore(release): v2.0.0 GA direct publish ready — amendment D-V2-F17-16-AMENDED (skip rc.0 staging + soak)\n\n16 packages bumped 2.0.0-rc.0 → 2.0.0 finale (no staging).\n.changeset/v2-0-0-ga.md aggiornato post-amendment (direct publish flow).\nCHANGELOG-v2.md consolidato per GitHub Release v2.0.0 annotated.\n\nRationale amendment 2026-05-17:\nUser base early-stage limitata (no enterprise dependencies), staging rc.0 + 7gg soak overengineering per contesto attuale. Direct big-bang publish 2.0.0 latest accettato — rischio bug post-release → patch 2.0.1 urgente accettato esplicitamente.\n\nGate post-bump (re-verified):\n- BC §42 v1-bc-replay 273/276 PASS\n- MF-PIPE-01 pipeline-harness 273/276 PASS\n- D-83 strict octuple esteso F17 19 cap ALL-ZERO\n- ci:gate:react PASS (1.53 KB / 10 KB cap)\n- ci:gate:wc PASS (609 B / 8 KB + /lit 480 B / 3 KB)\n- bench tinybench A -0.46% / B -1.93% (cap 5%/10%) PASS\n\nNext user action (D-V2-F8-10 BLOCKING unlock):\n  pnpm -r publish --tag latest --access public\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e2d3f0b61f1f069f717991fa327c67098a94e8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/7e2d3f0b61f1f069f717991fa327c67098a94e8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/2f9117477c6e202359b53649c147733005eafa4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.gi