n + bench src/baseline-v1.json — NON viola packages/*/src/ source code lock).\n\nCross-fase gate empirical PASS:\n- BC §42 v1-bc-replay 273/276 PASS (3 skipped)\n- MF-PIPE-01 pipeline-harness 273/276 PASS\n- Bench A -4.29% / B -6.08% within cap 5%/10% (new baseline)\n- ci:gate:react publint + attw + size-limit 1.53 KB ≤ 10 KB PASS\n- ci:gate:wc publint + attw + size-limit 609 B + 480 B ≤ 8 KB + 3 KB PASS\n\nReady for HC1 (npm publish --tag next staging).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c14f18e26433a819419705b0b7ddcdfeb40f366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/3c14f18e26433a819419705b0b7ddcdfeb40f366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/798aef934bb30c0b929f1fe4c1d84225b7ad36c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commit/798aef934bb30c0b929f1fe4c1d84225b7ad36c2","no