2 warn-then-proceed) + factory result normalize carryover F9 4-step priority + 5 error codes literal union (REQ MF-MF-02 + D-V2-F15-12).\n\nFiles:\n- src/internal/combine-signals.ts: OR-merge AbortSignal + abortPromise helper (carryover F9 mf-esm)\n- src/share-scope-conflict.ts: compareShareScopes warn + emit topic microfrontend.mf.share.version-mismatch, 3-strategy host version detection (window globale + __webpack_share_scopes__ + Issue #4071 fallback no-false-positive), semver minimal check inline (no semver dep, ~120B)\n- src/normalize.ts: factory result normalize 4-step priority (exportName -> default -> named -> throw MF_REMOTE_FACTORY_FAILED) con rich diagnostic details\n- src/types/descriptor.ts: ModuleFederationLoaderDefinition esteso con exportName + timeoutMs\n- src/errors.ts: createMfModuleFederationError factory helper aggiunto\n- src/mf-loader.ts: moduleFederationLoader implementation completa — validation + peer dep loadMfRuntime + init() idempotent + share scope conflict invocation + loadRemote race con combineSignals timeout 15000ms + error code mapping via regex (LOAD_REMOTE_ENTRY_FAILED/scope-not-found/module-not-found/factory-failed) + normalize integration + LoadedModule shape return + __resetModuleFederationLoaderForTests / __injectMfRuntimeForTests testing helpers\n\nMF Issue #4071 share scope detection documentato deferred V2.1 (planner-time micro-decision risolto — share-scope-conflict.ts JSDoc + doc-link github.com/module-federation/core/issues/4071).\n\nTypecheck PASS.\n\nREQ-IDs: MF-MF-01, MF-MF-02\nDecisions: D-V2-F15-09, D-V2-F15-10, D-V2-F15-12, D-V2-F15-19","tree":{"sha":"9a7ea8c4f132f6c4a4a2f040b09b33bf6dbd398b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/9a7ea8c4f132f6c4a4a2f040b09b33bf6dbd398b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/f7c9cabaaf05fb2af367762fcf1d0aff0278b1b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}