pagation + cause ES2022 + factory createMfIframeError (D-V2-F15-12)\n- client.test.ts (8 test) — createIframeClient subpath /client validate hostOrigin + factory shape no broker + publish/sendError/subscribe envelope + handshake reject su close + targetOrigin no wildcard (REQ MF-IFRAME-05 + REQ MF-IFRAME-04 parallel)\n- bridge.test.ts (8 test) — BridgeManager onMessage 5-step chain (origin → Valibot → rate-limit → LRU → dispatch) + handshake state machine + timeout + sendMessage dual-defense ''*'' ban + close idempotent + replay detect\n\n66/66 PASS jsdom — 22 in più del target ~30. Coverage threshold vitest config raggiunti (90% statements/lines, 85% branches, 90% functions).\n\nD-V2-09 BLOCKING closure threat model coverage:\n- T-15-01 origin spoofing ✓ bridge.test\n- T-15-02 schema injection ✓ bridge-schemas.test\n- T-15-03 ID replay ✓ lru-dedup.test\n- T-15-04 stale timestamp ✓ lru-dedup.test\n- T-15-05 targetOrigin wildcard ✓ origin-validator.test + client.test + bridge.test\n- T-15-06 DoS flood ✓ rate-limiter.test\n- T-15-07 sandbox erosion ✓ iframe-loader.test\n- T-15-08 subpath client broker ✓ client.test (audit-grep no broker)\n- T-15-09 mfId spoofing ✓ lru-dedup.test per-tuple scoping","tree":{"sha":"1dbd56ebcea32086d6718ff5c3e46bf332a6a770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/1dbd56ebcea32086d6718ff5c3e46bf332a6a770"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/ce65ef0cc91d2348d6480e4bb8d5dea99b400716","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm