/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commits/ae9ff14070b973f14387569c3d07d40b67dac5b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T15:18:07Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T15:18:07Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"feat(15-03): @gluezero/mf-iframe client.ts subpath /client minimal in-iframe SDK no broker (REQ MF-IFRAME-05 T-15-07)\n\ncreateIframeClient(opts) factory — minimal postMessage wrapper per code che gira DENTRO l''iframe:\n- handshake(): send gz:handshake + await gz:ready ACK con timeout default 15000ms\n- publish(topic, data): wrap gz:publish envelope\n- subscribe(topic, handler): wrap gz:subscribe + register listener filtrato per topic\n- getContext(keys?): wrap gz:context:get + await gz:context:update response via correlationId\n- sendError(code, message, details?): wrap gz:error envelope\n- close(): cleanup removeEventListener + reject pending\n\nREQ MF-IFRAME-05 isolation gate enforced:\n- ZERO import @gluezero/core (no broker exposure cross-frame)\n- ZERO import @gluezero/microfrontends\n- ZERO Valibot import (host-side responsibility — bundle minimo)\n- crypto.randomUUID inline (no nanoid dep, ~130B savings)\n- hostOrigin MANDATORY + ''*'' BANNED runtime (REQ MF-IFRAME-04 parallel client-side dual-defense)\n\nMarker __mfIframeClientLoaded export per audit-grep tree-shake fail detection. Origin check parallel host-side: accetta solo ev.origin === hostOrigin (silently ignore altri).\n\nBundle target ≤ 3 KB gzip (cap separato da dist/index.js 10 KB).","tree":{"sha":"233b673f90005aefb399f52b6ce8ff768d8a7583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/233b673f90005aefb399f52b6ce8ff768d8a7583"},"url":"https://api.g