-level DedupRegistry + RateLimiter per-process scope (D-V2-F15-27 no Service Locator, coerente F9 mf-esm).\n\nWeakMap MOUNTED_IFRAMES per ctx→iframe+bridge tracking lifecycle mount/unmount. unmount cleanup bridge.close + iframe.remove + dedup.clearForMf + limiter.clearForMf — no memory leak.\n\ncreateSandbox F13 sblocco: NO bridge auto-start (isolation-only), iframe baseline + Strategy A mutation cast su mount.element analog F13 shadow-dom.\n\nREQ-IDs: MF-IFRAME-01, MF-SEC-01","tree":{"sha":"1e0ed97515b1657f1f2bb7b6a4f38f2c0e6f785f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/1e0ed97515b1657f1f2bb7b6a4f38f2c0e6f785f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/00c51680060cd6fe11947fea9f757c0c4236ed3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio/GlueZero/commit/00c51680060cd6fe11947fea9f757c0c4236ed3e","node_id":"C_kwDOSRBhh9oAKDAwYzUxNjgwMDY