 + onMessage 5-step chain (origin check FIRST → Valibot strict parse → rate limit → LRU dedup → dispatch 9 message types) + handshake state machine idle→handshaking→ready→closed + sendMessage helper con validateTargetOrigin runtime PRIMARY (REQ MF-IFRAME-04 dual-defense) + close cleanup idempotent.\n\nD-V2-09 BLOCKING closure threats mitigati nel bridge:\n- T-15-01 Origin spoofing: event.origin !== expectedOrigin → emit topic origin-mismatch + SILENT reject (no throw cascade anti-DoS amplification)\n- T-15-02 Schema injection: v.safeParse(BridgeMessageSchema) → emit topic schema-invalid on fail\n- T-15-03 Replay: dedup.isReplay() → emit topic replay-detected\n- T-15-06 DoS flood: limiter.shouldDrop() → silent drop (limiter emette topic 1×/window)\n- T-15-09 mfId spoofing: per-tuple (origin, mfId) LRU scoping enforced via dedup\n- T-15-04..05 targetOrigin: validateTargetOrigin runtime assert pre-postMessage\n\nsafePublish defensive wrapper: try-catch su broker.publish per evitare cascade fail nel bridge handler. generateMessageId fallback per environment senza crypto.randomUUID.","tree":{"sha":"36769b2f2e7ff4dfa6694f76f0fceee6411e08f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/36769b2f2e7ff4dfa6694f76f0fceee6411e08f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/f9e2746ae379bf8322ce06159561121c6fb72b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizat