rame rate-limiter.ts fixed-window 100 msg/s drop+emit topic 1x/window (D-V2-F15-04 T-15-06)\n\nToken-bucket fixed-window 100 msg/s per mfId. O(1) increment + reset on window roll (1000 ms). NO sliding-window (O(log n) overhead + memoria proporzionale al cap); NO token-bucket bursty (vogliamo enforcement strict).\n\nDrop silently lato bridge handler (NO throw cascade — anti-DoS amplification REQ MF-SEC-04). Emit topic microfrontend.iframe.bridge.rate-limited UNA volta per window (warned flag) con payload {mfId, origin, droppedCount, windowMs, timestamp}.\n\nDefensive: broker.publish errors catched no-op (publish fail non deve affossare drop). clearForMf su unmount + clearAll testing. RATE_LIMIT_MSG_PER_SEC=100 + WINDOW_MS=1000 const esportate.","tree":{"sha":"b0d4ad96e23faf2109f5def0ddb0cc54e80d8e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/b0d4ad96e23faf2109f5def0ddb0cc54e80d8e96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/e4bb801ac60f42da14fd55319c50c6ef98ee9876","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github