-05-15T10:19:29Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"feat(15-03): @gluezero/mf-iframe lru-dedup.ts custom LRU 500 + replay-guard 30s dual-defense (D-V2-F15-02..03 T-15-02..03)\n\nCustom LRU impl NO lru-cache library (bundle 4 KB bloat — viola cap 10 KB stretto). Map<\\`origin::mfId\\`, TupleLru<messageId, timestamp>> con cap 500 per tuple. Insertion-order eviction Map spec ES2015.\n\nReplay guard dual-defense (D-V2-F15-03): (a) Math.abs(now - timestamp) > 30000ms → reject FIRST (cheaper short-circuit, no LRU pollution stale id); (b) messageId già in LRU → reject. Per-tuple scoping (origin, mfId) previene cross-MF id collision (T-15-09 microFrontendId spoofing).\n\nMemory peak ~50 KB su 100 MF concurrent burst @100 msg/s 1s window dedup. clearForMf / clearAll exposed per unmount cleanup + testing reset.","tree":{"sha":"623973e7d7e8b5a187431fcdf1958cbf5573efc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/623973e7d7e8b5a187431fcdf1958cbf5573efc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/81a72d068e2c332946ff554eec25ba3687c9b5ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.c