thor":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:09:21Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:09:21Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"test(15-02): @gluezero/mf-web-component Tier-1 jsdom 34 test PASS\n\n5 file __tier1__/*.test.ts coprono D-V2-F15-05..08 + D-V2-F15-12:\n\nerrors.test.ts (6 test):\n- instanceof MfWebComponentError + Error per ognuno dei 4 literal codes\n- BrokerError shape inline (category/code/microFrontendId/details)\n- cause ES2022 propagation via super(message, {cause})\n- originalError auto-alias a cause se undefined\n- factory createMfWebComponentError ritorna instance\n- isBrokerError duck-typing compatibility\n\ncontext-dispatch.test.ts (6 test):\n- mode ''property'' reference identity preserved via setter\n- mode ''attribute'' subset JSON {tenantId, locale, environment, direction} valido\n- mode ''event'' CustomEvent(''gluezero:context'', {detail.context, bubbles:false, composed:false})\n- mode invalid → MF_WC_CONTEXT_MODE_INVALID\n- locale undefined → field omesso dal JSON attribute\n- context null/undefined → \"{}\" valido (no throw)\n\nwhenDefined-await.test.ts (7 test):\n- happy path resolve pre-timeout\n- resolves mid-flight race quando element definito dopo call\n- timeout 50ms → MF_WC_DEFINE_TIMEOUT con details {elementName, timeoutMs, elapsedMs}\n- ctx.signal pre-aborted → reject immediato (raw AbortError NO MF_WC_DEFINE_TIMEOUT)\n- ctx.signal mid-flight abort → reject + cleanup\n- timeoutMs=0 defensive → default 15000 ms\n- timeoutMs=NaN defensive → default 15000 ms\n\nwc-loader.test.ts (12 test):\n- type discriminator ''web-component'' + load function shape\n- url mancante/non-string/non-empty → MF_WC_SCRIPT_LOAD_FAILED\n- elementName mancante/senza dash → MF_WC_SCRIPT_LOAD_FAILED (WHATWG kebab-case)\n- contextMode bogus → MF_WC_CONTEXT_MODE_INVALID\n- happy path reuse-on-collision → LoadedModule shape {module, lifecycle, metadata.reused: true}\n- default contextMode=''property'' quando non specificato (D-V2-F15-05)\n- contextMode override ''attribute'' preservato nel metadata\n- timeoutMs override + default 15000 nel metadata\n- import() fail su URL invalid → MF_WC_SCRIPT_LOAD_FAILED o MF_WC_DEFINE_TIMEOUT\n- lifecycle mount/unmount round-trip + WeakMap idempotent unmount\n\nreuse-on-collision.test.ts (3 test):\n- console.warn regex match [mf-wc] custom element ''NAME'' already defined + mfId\n- reuse NO throw (warning-level)\n- 2 MF stesso elementName → entrambi reusati + 2 warn distinti\n\nTotale 34 test PASS jsdom environment (vitest run).","tree":{"sha":"7040c1e2943f6abd5b23d86a308e7ce833472855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/7040c1e2943f6abd5b23d86a308e7ce833472855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/f5a7b6e24594f4a257369e4f72b0fe1b7c7973f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com