 + html undefined default + isolation policy dom!=''shadow-dom'' passthrough).\n  - 4 test type:''component'' (F15 adapter delega + adapter assente HTML stub + no target\n    + selector lookup).\n  - 4 test type:''event'' (custom topic + default FALLBACK_EVENT_DEFAULT_TOPIC + source\n    descriptor F1 D-23 + timestamp number).\n  - 6 test type:''custom'' (sync void + async resolved + sync throw + rejected Promise +\n    handler undefined + ctx parameter passed).\n  - 1 test type:''none'' (no-op + emit observability).\n  - 5 test emit unificato (1-call-per-dispatch + payload shape + opts source + custom-failed\n    emit + html-skipped emit).\n  - 1 test return Promise<RenderResult> async support.\n\nAcceptance Task 2: pnpm --filter @gluezero/fallbacks test esit 0 (113 test PASS — 84 baseline + 29 new).\n\nD-83 strict septuple: solo packages/fallbacks/src/ modificato.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18bad2acf8b981e157cad3b926b729437eeb1063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/trees/18bad2acf8b981e157cad3b926b729437eeb1063"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omardimarzio/GlueZero/git/commits/fc7d75dbdb291b6e81826e7e38f34074cc800166","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406036?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omardimarzio","id":406036,"login":"omardimarzio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjAzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omardimarzio/received_events","repos_url":"htt