3009eefb65529ebbb3b25c21120fd3601/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T09:16:55Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T09:16:55Z","email":"omar@trova.net","name":"omardimarzio"},"message":"feat(14-04): 4 renderers fallback (html/component/event/custom) — MF-FALLBACK-05 step 1/3\n\n- renderers/html.ts (~95 LoC): target chain priority (a) mountElement (W7 fix\n  HTMLElement | ShadowRoot | undefined) → (b) document.querySelector(selector) →\n  (c) null + console.warn + fallbackType:''html-skipped''. F13 isolation respect via\n  SERVICE_ISOLATION lookup: policy.dom=''shadow-dom'' + host.shadowRoot presente →\n  target = shadowRoot (preserve CSS scoping shadow boundary). NO XSS sanitization\n  runtime (P-13 governance disclaimer host-controlled config).\n- renderers/component.ts (~110 LoC): SERVICE_FRAMEWORK_ADAPTER (string literal locale\n  per D-83 strict septuple — F8 services.ts NON pre-dichiara) lookup F15 future →\n  adapter.renderFallbackComponent(component, target, error, ctx) delega. Adapter\n  assente → graceful console.warn + HTML stub data-gz-fallback-stub generic\n  (NON-throw, diff F13 iframe-stub che throw IFRAME_ADAPTER_REQUIRED). W9 fix\n  escapeAttr regex /[<>\"''&backtick]/g 6-char coverage attribute-context defense-in-depth.\n- renderers/event.ts (~65 LoC): broker.publish(definition.topic ?? FALLBACK_EVENT_DEFAULT_TOPIC,\n  payload {microFrontendId, lifecyclePhase, error, fallbackApplied:true, timestamp})\n  con source descriptor F1 D-23 {type:''plugin'', id:''fallbacks'', name:''@gluezero/fallbacks''}\n  + deliveryMode:''sync'' (consistency governance F8).\n- renderers/custom.ts (~50 LoC): await handler(error, ctx) async + try/catch +\n  result instanceof Promise check (micro-perf evita await su sync void). Success →\n  fallbackType:''custom''. Throw sync o rejected Promise → console.error +\n  fallbackType:''custom-failed''.\n\nPatterns:\n- Rule 4 stretto F13 iframe-stub.ts per