nn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echel0nn","id":16112212,"login":"echel0nn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTEyMjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/commits/673ec40412e746b01f2dc627aba10105c8bca2ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:14:27Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:14:27Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"message":"test: prune dropped executive + saved-filters test residue\n\nThe executive router and /saved-filters endpoints were removed by the\nreqs 46/49 drops, but their test callers were never migrated: a top-level\nimport of the deleted aila.api.routers.executive module in\ntest_executive_team_scope.py halted the whole backend suite at collection\nunder -x. Delete the executive-only and saved-filter-only test files, drop\nthe three saved-filter cases and the /saved-filters envelope-sweep entry\nfrom the plan-138 endpoint tests, and move the still-live report_tasks and\nworker-registration coverage out of the old executive-reporting file into a\nfocused test_report_tasks_registration.py (the stale _generate_risk_summary_pdf\nassertion for the deleted helper goes with the cutover). The frontend\nexecutive e2e specs targeting the removed /executive routes are removed too.","tree":{"sha":"12c5bdc0e9371b02f6c89437ec69fb7b1dcd14da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/trees/12c5bdc0e9371b02f6c89437ec69fb7