ion, per-phase mini-workflows, an android_mcp tool guide, a\nknowledge.retrieve section, an IDA decision table, and a delegation\nprotocol synced to the seven registry capabilities and their specialists,\nfiled through ledger_writes. Every code-enforced trigger phrase is kept\nverbatim (variant-exhaustion list, negative-verdict vocabulary, review\nvotes, edit_outcome).\n\nMalware: dedupes the anti-pattern rules and the per-persona CRITICAL RULE\nblock (re-rendered at runtime), moves the roster to one home, and adds a\nknowledge.retrieve section plus delegation to the wired specialists\n(re via alucard, crypto via vincent) via ledger_writes. The fan-out\nexhaustion phrase list stays byte-synchronized with its regex.\n\nForensics: adds markdown headings and per-lane API cards (disk, registry,\nbinary) and names the evidence lanes. No delegation directives, since the\nforensics specialist spawn path is not wired; that language stays deferred\nto the specialist-roster work. The static-analysis and closure-discipline\nblocks are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"0263ac161c557b254de1f5f1e1c3451b20e85ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/trees/0263ac161c557b254de1f5f1e1c3451b20e85ed3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/commits/2cb05119b5b65cef711f7df8cd17b17b299355c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16112212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echel0nn","id":16112212,"login":"echel0nn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTEyMjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/orgs","re