repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/commits/70b41a17edea10c9b1ce7054821c833d8290b349/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:54:41Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:54:41Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"message":"feat(console): floatable chat widgets around the console chat\n\nThe admin \"widget layout\" nav entry and its per-user layout endpoint\nhad no real widget to render. This adds a curated catalog of seven\nread-only widgets that dock as floaters around the chat panel through\nthe shared window primitive: bound-case, task-queue-by-status, monthly\nbudget vs configured cap, cross-module recent findings, MCP server\nhealth, pending dante proposals, and a local/UTC clock. Each sources\nits data from an endpoint that already exists (or, for recent findings,\nmerges the live per-module lists client-side, since no cross-module\nlist route exists); none render fabricated values, and every widget\ncarries honest loading, error, and empty states. Layout persists per\nuser through the existing GET/PUT /widgets/layout, with the admin page\npromoted from a blank DataPage stub to a bespoke editor (hide/show,\nreorder, reset, save). Floaters hide while a non-minimized module page\nis open and reappear when it closes, matching the chat gate. Side\nfloaters clamp to the free gap so they never cross the 820px chat panel\nor the 216px left rail, verified at 1280x800 and 1920x1080.","tree":{"sha":"0c1037f547a0b9b34f09ad36a87b641838fd7427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/trees/0c1037f547a0b9b34f09ad36a87b641838fd7427"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/commits/70b41a17edea10c9b1ce7054821c833d8290b349","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16112212?v=4","events_url":"https://