url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echel0nn","id":16112212,"login":"echel0nn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTEyMjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/commits/5eea4228aa495054b1f10c20a9393cf5be6d4e53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:24:02Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:24:02Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"message":"feat(vr): target-first detail pane for vr targets\n\nSelecting a vr:targets row rendered only its investigations, so the target''s own status, why-failed reason, per-stage breakdown, descriptor, and APK overview were never shown. A bespoke VRTargetDetail detail body now composes these as keyboard-operable accordion sections and adds an action toolbar wired to the existing resume/analyze/rank/refresh/edit/delete endpoints (plus APK static and MASVS audits for android_apk). Stage rows follow the backend applicable-stages split so no-op stages are hidden; a live single-target fetch keeps the pane fresh after an action since the list snapshot never re-syncs. Delete moves into the toolbar, so the generic header delete for vr:targets is dropped.","tree":{"sha":"1e49dde99f0bcf3c37f70f7bbb5fa485e99cc3d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/trees/1e49dde99f0bcf3c37f70f7bbb5fa485e99cc3d2