users/echel0nn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echel0nn","id":16112212,"login":"echel0nn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTEyMjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echel0nn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/commits/f0ddc5b0d2ff32f2dfd5fde9eaec5326a0c8e1a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:39:08Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:39:08Z","email":"melih.sahin@protonmail.com","name":"echel0nn"},"message":"refactor(vuln): replace inner topbar with a slim breadcrumb\n\nThe vulnerability page rendered a 34px chrome bar that repeated\napp-level elements (AILA tag, \"live\" indicator, clock, systems-count\npill) inside a single module page and ate vertical space. Replace it\nwith a light single-line breadcrumb (nav aria-label, aria-current on the\nactive segment, keyboard-activatable buttons, .vuln-crumb hover and\nfocus-visible states) that keeps the section switcher and drops the\nrepeated chrome. The systems segment is removed from the nav since the\nregistry moves to a platform Systems page. ConsoleWindow''s footer\nalready owns the single leave control, so the breadcrumb adds none. Also\ndrops the now-unused clock interval, systems-count query, and the dead\npad2/formatClock helpers.","tree":{"sha":"103c2a068eb38d3a7fd6fa1397c198b7fd8aa89b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/AILA/git/trees/103c2a068eb38d3a7fd6fa1397c198b7fd8aa89b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/project-lambda-zero/A