nd the access-point/\nno-go draw tool (ParcelConfigDrawTool) attach independent Cesium LEFT_CLICK\nhandlers on the same canvas with no coordination, so when both were active a\nsingle map click fired both (a click meant to add a no-go vertex also dropped\nan A/B point, and vice versa).\n\nEnforce mutual exclusion at the orchestrator: starting A->B picking turns the\ndraw tool off; starting access/zone draw cancels A->B picking; switching\nparcels tears down both.","tree":{"sha":"cd975bf6b5cbb83131fe983a6619e03711ba4668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-gis-routing/git/trees/cd975bf6b5cbb83131fe983a6619e03711ba4668"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-gis-routing/git/commits/fa77a29c0a80e7dbbe31430a33ac8bc94147baba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-gis-routing/commit/fa77a29c0a80e7dbbe31430a33ac8bc94147baba","node_id":"C_kwDOSREpZdoAKGZhNzdhMjljMGE4MGU3ZGJiZTMxND