ter-readable layout:\n\n- Name as H1 + sub-tagline that places me (EE student, Master\n  Electrician, solo builder shipping across domains)\n- Visible LinkedIn / email / location badges\n- Explicit \"open to student roles and internships\" line — wide net,\n  not specialized\n- Featured projects with stack chips, in priority order:\n  xiao-edge-audio (embedded — strongest signal) → hunter-max-oss\n  (security, with Anthropic CVP credential) → ARIA (AI infra) →\n  TRACE (full-stack live deployment)\n- Stack table grouped by domain\n- Background table covering HIT, U-tron, ORT, national service\n- GitHub stats + top-languages cards\n\nHonest framing throughout: TRACE described as live but pre real-world\nclinical validation; nothing oversold beyond what the linked READMEs\nsubstantiate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd0cf790303a2fc0457bba5d62d6e10490358ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/clutchitggs/git/trees/dd0cf790303a2fc0457bba5d62d6e10490358ab3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/clutchitggs/git/commits/e7f01b55a637e24c91d531baf7456a8b11be5077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166488890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scrappychoko","id":166488890,"login":"scrappychoko","node_id":"U_kgDOCexrOg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/repos","site_admin":false,"st