ed without submission\n  - Cloudinary: submitted via Bugcrowd, did not survive cross-account\n    testing, closed as theoretical\n  Net result: zero confirmed bugs, several lessons. The kill-list was\n  refined from these \"looks like a bug, isn''t\" patterns.\n\nThe candor is the point: the tool''s value is in filtering noise, and\nthe kill-list''s credibility comes from the false-positive shapes\nthese engagements taught it to drop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cb663aa039679326cd561bd20a505e10a91c5d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/trees/5cb663aa039679326cd561bd20a505e10a91c5d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/commits/75bee81fed6b00a0a5952a04f462f006209a9054","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166488890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scrappychoko","id":166488890,"login":"scrappychoko","node_id":"U_kgDOCexrOg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scrappychoko","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commit/75bee81fed6b00a0a5952a04f462f006209a9054","node_id":"C_kwDOSRGVo9oAKDc1YmVlODFmZWQ2YjAwYTBhNTk1MmEwNGY0NjJmMDA2MjA5YTkwNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commit/55845cba8015c4a932b78f47a3d752dae62938b4","sha":"55845cba8015c4a932b78f47a3d752dae62938b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/55845cba8015c4a932b78f47a3d752dae62938b4"}],"sha":"75bee81fed6b00a0a5952a04f462f006209a9054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/75bee81fed6b00a0a5952a04f462f006209a9054"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/55845cba8015c4a932b78f47a3d752dae62938b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:41:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Tal Nagar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:41:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Tal Nagar"},"message":"Add Production deployment section\n\nThe full pipeline is intended to run as a long-lived daemon, tested on a\nsmall DigitalOcean VPS. Adding this section makes the deployment story\nexplicit (provider 