ail":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"scrappy coco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T19:07:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"scrappy coco"},"message":"Rewrite architecture section to match slim-v1 reality\n\nThe previous diagram described a generic recon -> scan -> AI flow and\nomitted everything that actually makes slim-v1 distinct: the four-phase\nper-target pipeline, Phase 3a Katana + spec mapping, the Phase 3b\nScout-Sniper ReAct agent split, and the async semaphore-capped\norchestrator (pipeline.py) that replaces the legacy sequential mode.\n\nRepo layout updated to surface pipeline.py, react_agent.py, api_mapper\nand the sniper specialists. Disclaimer footnote noting the author''s\nAnthropic Cyber Verification Program approval.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f793603106d28cb550ee7c6f418718ad12cd1552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/trees/f793603106d28cb550ee7c6f418718ad12cd1552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/commits/e131e7a4fefea3ae9fe037bd439b793211e858f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commit/e131e7a4fefea3ae9fe037bd439b793211e858f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSRGVo9oAKGUxMzFlN2E0ZmVmZWEzYWU5ZmUwMzdiZDQzOWI3OTMyMTFlODU4ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commit/b1b1879347f176b750439bb1685f7d3a0d1b3169","sha":"b1b1879347f176b750439bb1685f7d3a0d1b3169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/b1b1879347f176b750439bb1685f7d3a0d1b3169"}],"sha":"e131e7a4fefea3ae9fe037bd439b793211e858f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/e131e7a4fefea3ae9fe037bd439b793211e858f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/commits/b1b1879347f176b750439bb1685f7d3a0d1b3169/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:47:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"scrappy coco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:47:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"scrappy coco"},"message":"Public release: Deep Read + tiered pipeline\n\nSolo bug-bounty research framework. Deep Read parses webpack Module\nFederation chunk maps to expand SPA attack surfaces from a few entry\nbundles to 100+, extracts the API surface from minified JS, and ranks\nendpoints by attack potential using an LLM. Pipeline schedules\nrecon + nuclei + JS analysis + tiered LLM review with per-tier daily\nbudgets, posts to Discord on approval.\n\nFor authorized security research only — see README disclaimer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f99482998ff2b7d7fae68974e33398b9dbad74cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/trees/f99482998ff2b7d7fae68974e33398b9dbad74cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/git/commits/b1b1879347f176b750439bb1685f7d3a0d1b3169","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/clutchitggs/hunter-max-oss/comm